{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774121989,"nonce":"Sw0wEKk5P61cQlrNQLf2BAu/VQA=","title":"Header tabs: icon/text/both display mode with user setting","message":"Unify the Mandible header tab buttons to support three display modes:\n1. Text only (current default, except Settings which is already an icon)\n2. Icons only\n3. Both icon + text\n\nUser selects their preference in the Settings tab (Appearance section). Persisted via settings API.\n\nIcon assignments:\n- Chat: speech bubble (Lucide MessageSquare or similar)\n- History: clock (Lucide Clock/History)\n- Monitor: chart/activity (Lucide Activity or BarChart)\n- Issues: bug (Lucide Bug)\n- Inbox: custom SVG from agent-inbox.svg in repo root\n- Auth: shield/lock (Lucide Shield or Lock)\n- Settings: gear (already an icon)\n- Overflow tabs (Presets, Graph, Switchboard, etc.): appropriate Lucide icons\n\nUse Lucide icons (install lucide-preact or inline SVGs). The custom inbox icon should be used as-is.","files":null}]}